Name:Rules pilot NNN - Cycling is not casting, but it is cycling
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Easy
Description:It is your first main phase. You control Lightning Rift (whenever a player cycles a card, you may pay {1}; if you do, it deals 2 damage to any target) and have Iron Will (cycling {2}) in hand with three red mana floating. The opponent is at 2 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-cycling-trigger | Cycling is an activated ability of the card in hand, not casting it (CR 702.29a), and it triggers abilities that look for cycling (CR 702.29c): you can't cast Iron Will without white, but cycling it for two and paying one for Lightning Rift deals 2
